I go out of my house.
I walk to the BEST bus stop.
It is morning now.
But the sunlight on the street is harsh.
The weather is very hot today.
Here, the city's weather is hot and sticky.
I look for shade.
There is a large tree near the bus stop.
Under the tree, there is a small patch of shade.
I go there.
I stand in the shade.
A woman also stands near me.
She says, "It is very hot today!"
I smile, and say, "Yes, madam, that is true."
I remember the weather forecast.
In the evening, it will rain.
Then the weather will be cool.
I see my BEST bus on the road.
The bus comes to the stop.
I enter the bus.
